{% doc %}
  The current page's programme as a brand scope: gallery, foundation or artists-for-kids (DESIGN.md
  §3.3). From the page's programme field, or the exhibition entry's; blank is the Gallery. Lessons
  (the ArtReach videos) are always Artists for Kids (DS-70). The
  layout sets data-gs-brand from it (programme colours, DS-04) and the header picks its logo from it
  (DS-47).

  Capture the output and strip it before using it.

  @example
  {%- capture brand -%}{% render 'gs-brand' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  assign programme = ''
  if page != blank
    assign programme = page.metafields.custom.programme.value
  elsif metaobject.system.type == 'lesson'
    assign programme = 'Artists for Kids'
  elsif metaobject != blank
    assign programme = metaobject.programme.value
  endif
  render 'gs-programme', value: programme
-%}
